/// A test [`Runner`] whose `run_streamed` succeeds and yields exactly one
/// non-terminal event (`TokenDelta { "hi" }`), then ends the stream WITHOUT a
/// terminal `RunCompleted`/`RunFailed`. Exercises the streaming transports'
